%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 8
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  dialogues:
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: With the new parts installed, the lift carried their wagon up the
        cliff. Rivet gave a thumbs-up.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC0C8 \uBD80\uD488\uC744 \uB07C\uC6B4 \uC2B9\uAC15\uAE30\uAC00
        \uC218\uB808\uB97C \uC2E3\uACE0 \uC62C\uB77C\uAC14\uB2E4. \uB9AC\uBCB3\uC740
        \uC5C4\uC9C0\uB97C \uCE58\uCF1C\uB4E4\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 2506609028298646760, guid: e2f4ff60e77b4ed4f934145f27f9f223, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Rivet
      dialogue: Our cargo gets the first ride! I'm coming all the way with you.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB9AC\uBCB3"
      dialogue: "\uCCAB \uC6B4\uD589\uC740 \uC6B0\uB9AC \uC9D0\uBD80\uD130! \uB098\uB3C4
        \uB05D\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uAC19\uC774 \uAC08\uAC8C."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Rivet laid out their new gears and fittings. The merchant
        rested her chin on her hand and nodded.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uB9AC\uBCB3\uC774 \uC0C8 \uD1B1\uB2C8\uC640
        \uBD80\uD488\uC744 \uD3BC\uCCD0 \uBCF4\uC600\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740
        \uD131\uC744 \uAD34\uACE0 \uACE0\uAC1C\uB97C \uB044\uB355\uC600\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Useful work. But that key keeps getting more valuable.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uC4F8 \uB9CC\uD558\uB124. \uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC800 \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB294
        \uC810\uC810 \uADC0\uD574\uC9C0\uAC70\uB4E0."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Before the growing coin stacks, the merchant produced blank parchment
        and a quill.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB192\uC544\uC9C4 \uB3D9\uC804 \uB354\uBBF8 \uC55E\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC774 \uBE48 \uC591\uD53C\uC9C0\uC640 \uAE43\uD39C\uC744
        \uB0B4\uBC00\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: The last forest road is lost in fog. Bring me guiding scrolls.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC232\uAE38\uC740 \uC548\uAC1C\uD22C\uC131\uC774\uC57C.
        \uAE38\uC7A1\uC774 \uC8FC\uBB38\uC11C\uB97C \uAC00\uC838\uC640."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: This time they needed Lune the witch.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC774\uBC88\uC5D4 \uB9C8\uB140 \uB8EC\uC758 \uB3C4\uC6C0\uC774
        \uD544\uC694\uD588\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Lune looked up from the star she was drawing at her scribing desk.
        Enemies were swarming toward its light.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB8EC\uC740 \uD544\uC0AC\uB300\uC5D0\uC11C \uBCC4 \uBB38\uC591\uC744
        \uADF8\uB9AC\uB2E4 \uACE0\uAC1C\uB97C \uB4E4\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uBE5B\uC744 \uBCF8
        \uC801\uB4E4\uC774 \uC885\uC774\uB97C \uD5A5\uD574 \uBAB0\uB824\uC654\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 383150834362951310, guid: a216e9652b07ec141ae853211a65f2c0, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Lune
      dialogue: Just one stroke left. Not again!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB8EC"
      dialogue: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uD68D\uB9CC \uB0A8\uC558\uB294\uB370, \uB610!"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Rivet switched on the work lights while Mocha guarded the path. At
        last, Lune finished the final stroke.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB9AC\uBCB3\uC774 \uC791\uC5C5\uB4F1\uC744 \uCF1C\uACE0 \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00
        \uAE38\uBAA9\uC744 \uC9C0\uCF30\uB2E4. \uB8EC\uC740 \uB9C8\uCE68\uB0B4 \uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9
        \uD68D\uC744 \uADF8\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 383150834362951310, guid: a216e9652b07ec141ae853211a65f2c0, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Lune
      dialogue: Hang one at every fork. We'll need them on the way back, too. I'll
        come along.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB8EC"
      dialogue: "\uAC08\uB9BC\uAE38\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uD55C \uC7A5\uC529 \uAC78\uC5B4.
        \uB3CC\uC544\uC624\uB294 \uAE38\uC5D0\uB3C4 \uC4F8 \uAC70\uC57C. \uB098\uB3C4
        \uAC19\uC774 \uAC08\uAC8C."
